WEBVTT

00:00:03.050 --> 00:00:04.660
Nanael-san?

00:00:04.840 --> 00:00:06.720
Nanael-san!?

00:00:06.720 --> 00:00:08.980
Where in the world did you go?

00:00:08.980 --> 00:00:11.900
Nanael-san!

00:00:13.460 --> 00:00:15.920
So this is where you were?

00:00:16.380 --> 00:00:18.240
So what is it?

00:00:18.240 --> 00:00:19.580
A summons from the head angel?

00:00:20.070 --> 00:00:22.210
That's not it!

00:00:22.210 --> 00:00:25.360
I don't just deliver messages all the time, you know.

00:00:25.360 --> 00:00:28.380
Leaving that aside, just what on earth are you doing?

00:00:29.210 --> 00:00:31.300
These are holy poses.

00:00:31.300 --> 00:00:32.940
Holy poses?

00:00:32.940 --> 00:00:36.260
Yeah. Ever since I started doing these, my body's felt so light.

00:00:36.640 --> 00:00:38.080
Wanna give it a try?

00:00:38.080 --> 00:00:40.770
No way! That's way too embarrassing!

00:00:41.180 --> 00:00:42.910
You'll get used to it, Get used to it!

00:00:42.910 --> 00:00:46.150
At first you need courage, but from then on, all you need is love!

00:00:46.150 --> 00:00:48.380
It's impossible.

00:00:48.380 --> 00:00:50.860
Anyway, the head angel is calling for you.

00:00:50.860 --> 00:00:53.650
So it was a summons after all!

00:00:53.650 --> 00:00:56.170
Welcome, I received your report.

00:00:56.170 --> 00:00:59.580
That being is the fallen angel Delmore, without a doubt.

00:01:00.220 --> 00:01:05.000
If he is really using Queen's Blade to cause suffering.

00:01:05.820 --> 00:01:08.420
we cannot afford to stand by and do nothing.

00:01:08.890 --> 00:01:12.680
You have done a good job, but for the moment, you must return to Earth.

00:01:20.240 --> 00:01:22.430
I am Queen Aldra.

00:01:22.430 --> 00:01:23.900
My subjects!

00:01:23.900 --> 00:01:26.490
The path to the arena has opened.

00:01:28.530 --> 00:01:30.000
So she says!

00:01:30.000 --> 00:01:32.440
Well, I <i>did</i> risk my life, you know!

00:01:32.440 --> 00:01:37.160
I am the only one who was able to obtain information on Aldra's conspiracy.

00:01:37.160 --> 00:01:40.010
Even if it meant that I would fall into the Land of the Dead!

00:01:40.010 --> 00:01:42.950
How splendid! As one would expect from the great archangel!

00:01:42.950 --> 00:01:46.780
With my faith having been fortified, I am trembling from head to toe.

00:01:46.780 --> 00:01:48.710
My body cannot stop shivering!

00:01:48.710 --> 00:01:53.200
In the end, my resolution brought the Head Angel to tears, and she didn't punish me!

00:01:53.200 --> 00:01:55.590
What a beautiful story!

00:01:55.590 --> 00:01:57.520
The truth is that

00:01:57.520 --> 00:02:02.190
Nanael-san misunderstood everything,
jumped to conclusions, and made rash assumptions.

00:02:02.190 --> 00:02:05.520
It's a good thing that she didn't fall into
the underworld even though she lost the holy milk!

00:02:05.520 --> 00:02:08.980
Hachi... are you trying to piss me off?

00:02:08.980 --> 00:02:12.350
Haven't you been a bit arrogant lately?

00:02:12.350 --> 00:02:14.900
I can't beat you, Nanael-san.

00:02:14.900 --> 00:02:19.860
This angel must be a subordinate of yours, I presume, Archangel-sama?

00:02:19.860 --> 00:02:22.160
An archangel?! Nanael-san?!

00:02:22.160 --> 00:02:23.090
Hm?

00:02:23.090 --> 00:02:25.670
Whoa, whoa, whoa... that's too much!

00:02:25.670 --> 00:02:29.150
That's a hoax! Isn't this some kind of grand impersonation?

00:02:29.150 --> 00:02:31.940
Shut up, shut up, shut up!

00:02:42.290 --> 00:02:45.020
Shizuka-san, it finally the time.

00:02:45.020 --> 00:02:48.430
The final battle upon which the fate of Hinomoto is riding is about to begin.

00:02:49.250 --> 00:02:51.260
Please give Leina-san your protection.

00:02:59.650 --> 00:03:04.540
A fight with that many people
watching would make me nervous.

00:03:04.540 --> 00:03:08.370
A warrior is not bothered by how many are watching them battle.

00:03:08.370 --> 00:03:09.660
Nowa: 10 points.

00:03:10.960 --> 00:03:12.260
Elina-sama!

00:03:12.260 --> 00:03:12.920
What is it?

00:03:13.710 --> 00:03:15.570
Please return to Gainos.

00:03:16.160 --> 00:03:17.880
What are you saying?

00:03:17.880 --> 00:03:22.310
Elina-sama, I believe your heart is not here, but in Gainos.

00:03:23.740 --> 00:03:24.800
My heart...

00:03:27.930 --> 00:03:31.610
Vagrant Warrior Leina, come forth!

00:03:36.940 --> 00:03:40.390
The successive champion of Queen's Blade,

00:03:40.390 --> 00:03:42.550
Queen Aldra.

00:03:54.440 --> 00:03:57.710
In this final Queen's Blade battle,

00:03:57.710 --> 00:04:00.470
I, Hachiel, the finest angel, will be the judge.

00:04:00.470 --> 00:04:03.620
Does either party object to this?

00:04:05.550 --> 00:04:08.700
There's someone who objects right here...

00:04:08.700 --> 00:04:10.220
Let Queen's Blade...

00:04:10.220 --> 00:04:11.310
commence!

00:04:19.730 --> 00:04:24.320
No one has survived after crossing swords with me.

00:04:24.910 --> 00:04:28.850
That is... something we won't know until we fight!

00:04:30.110 --> 00:04:30.830
Come.

00:04:40.610 --> 00:04:41.640
Not yet!

00:04:57.980 --> 00:04:58.750
Leina!

00:05:01.400 --> 00:05:04.150
She cannot even hit what's right in front of her...

00:05:04.150 --> 00:05:06.990
Aldra had this much strength?

00:05:06.990 --> 00:05:09.870
Leina is being outmatched...

00:05:09.870 --> 00:05:12.500
But she'll win!

00:05:12.500 --> 00:05:15.270
You're right. She just might win.

00:05:15.270 --> 00:05:17.190
Are you going anyway?

00:05:17.190 --> 00:05:19.690
Yeah, I'm going.

00:05:19.690 --> 00:05:21.420
Leina onee-chan said it...

00:05:21.420 --> 00:05:24.550
It's hard to lend a hand in difficult situations.

00:05:25.680 --> 00:05:27.300
I think that, too, so...

00:05:28.180 --> 00:05:32.030
'Course! It's admirable that you're going out to rescue your parents.

00:05:32.030 --> 00:05:34.800
However, it'll be impossible unarmed!

00:05:35.100 --> 00:05:36.850
And so...

00:05:36.850 --> 00:05:40.770
I'll give you this Sword of Ewindel!

00:05:41.360 --> 00:05:43.120
Here, don't you need it?

00:05:43.130 --> 00:05:44.920
Ah, thank you.

00:05:44.920 --> 00:05:47.120
It's only one gold coin.

00:05:47.120 --> 00:05:47.800
Eh?

00:05:47.800 --> 00:05:51.840
Don't worry, I'll let you pay in 36 easy installments!

00:05:51.840 --> 00:05:53.910
So do your best, little one!

00:05:53.910 --> 00:05:56.920
Thank you, but I don't need a sword.

00:05:58.850 --> 00:06:01.000
I'll leave it to you.

00:06:15.140 --> 00:06:19.010
Beloved Aldra, that sword is dangerous.

00:06:21.770 --> 00:06:24.400
It gives me an unpleasant feeling.

00:06:24.400 --> 00:06:28.690
It is a vile weapon, similar to the sword that sealed my body in eternal darkness.

00:06:30.340 --> 00:06:31.200
That can't be!

00:06:31.530 --> 00:06:35.760
Forgive me, Aldra. There is no need to become confused.

00:06:35.760 --> 00:06:38.080
You are the strongest.

00:06:38.080 --> 00:06:40.790
There is no way you could be defeated.

00:06:41.450 --> 00:06:43.500
However, you must not be timid.

00:06:43.920 --> 00:06:49.470
If you let this woman take the title of Queen, you cannot search for your little sister anymore.

00:06:50.680 --> 00:06:52.670
That's right.

00:06:52.670 --> 00:06:54.520
I must not lose!

00:06:54.520 --> 00:06:55.740
Headhunting Kick!

00:07:22.770 --> 00:07:24.420
I can't win?

00:07:24.970 --> 00:07:28.340
I was arrogant to think I could take on everyone's responsibility.

00:07:29.040 --> 00:07:30.710
And then something like this...

00:07:31.800 --> 00:07:33.180
Get up!

00:07:33.180 --> 00:07:33.740
Leina!

00:07:39.180 --> 00:07:41.480
That's the Thunderclap Strike!

00:07:51.850 --> 00:07:52.940
Warrior Kick?!

00:07:57.240 --> 00:07:58.180
Minions!

00:08:07.080 --> 00:08:11.880
By capturing the mind of her opponents in battle, she absorbs their techniques...

00:08:11.880 --> 00:08:16.600
Yes, that's Leina-san's strength. Her true strength.

00:08:16.600 --> 00:08:21.520
Fighting with pure feelings is Leina's strongest weapon!

00:08:26.210 --> 00:08:29.270
This is Airi onee-chan's sickle.

00:08:34.120 --> 00:08:35.610
There's no doubt.

00:08:39.030 --> 00:08:42.190
With this, Mommy and Daddy will...

00:08:43.140 --> 00:08:44.190
An intruder?

00:08:44.920 --> 00:08:49.790
Like I thought, that idiot's completely useless without me around.

00:08:49.790 --> 00:08:52.130
Just hold out a little longer, alright?

00:08:52.940 --> 00:08:55.380
You have no place left to run, boy.

00:08:59.310 --> 00:09:02.390
Please don't interfere.

00:09:02.390 --> 00:09:04.180
I can't do that.

00:09:06.310 --> 00:09:07.740
Rana...

00:09:09.390 --> 00:09:11.100
You have to do it quickly.

00:09:11.670 --> 00:09:13.190
Airi onee-chan!

00:09:26.330 --> 00:09:27.120
Now!

00:09:30.670 --> 00:09:35.010
I'll be taking your life force.

00:09:40.630 --> 00:09:42.420
Mommy!

00:09:42.420 --> 00:09:44.390
Can you hear me? Mommy!

00:09:47.480 --> 00:09:49.290
It wasn't enough?

00:09:51.250 --> 00:09:52.990
Mommy!

00:09:52.990 --> 00:09:55.130
Daddy!

00:09:55.130 --> 00:09:57.990
Thanks to you, I've returned.

00:09:57.990 --> 00:10:01.080
Thank you, little one.

00:10:01.080 --> 00:10:02.490
Onee-chan!

00:10:04.660 --> 00:10:08.750
What kind of mood are you guys making in here?

00:10:09.190 --> 00:10:12.420
You want to save your big-breasted mother, don't you?

00:10:12.420 --> 00:10:13.710
Ta-da!

00:10:15.300 --> 00:10:16.090
That's...

00:10:28.590 --> 00:10:31.900
I could see everything from within the stone.

00:10:31.900 --> 00:10:36.600
Rana, you've become a splendid son. I'm very proud of you!

00:10:44.860 --> 00:10:47.660
Cattleya... I've made you suffer, haven't I?

00:10:49.600 --> 00:10:51.750
Owen... it's really you?

00:10:51.750 --> 00:10:55.170
Hey, lady! There's no sake!

00:10:55.170 --> 00:10:57.170
Funikura-sama...

00:10:57.170 --> 00:10:58.550
There's no sake!

00:10:58.550 --> 00:11:00.080
Shut up!

00:11:00.080 --> 00:11:03.050
I won't associate with assholes like you anymore!

00:11:03.050 --> 00:11:05.100
Huh? What?

00:11:05.100 --> 00:11:07.390
Funikura-sama!

00:11:08.020 --> 00:11:12.980
Ms. Temptress, thank you very much for what you did for Rana.

00:11:12.980 --> 00:11:14.670
Nanael-san, you too...

00:11:14.670 --> 00:11:15.440
Hmm?

00:11:15.440 --> 00:11:19.360
We can just leave Funikura the way he is.

00:11:19.360 --> 00:11:22.900
Oh? Aren't you soft and flabby pink?

00:11:22.900 --> 00:11:24.140
And you're so small!

00:11:24.140 --> 00:11:25.610
Sorry for being so small.

00:11:26.160 --> 00:11:29.830
Well, this is as good a time as any to leave. Are you coming too?

00:11:29.830 --> 00:11:32.340
We're going to confront the Queen, right? I'll accompany you.

00:11:32.340 --> 00:11:36.460
But I'm not in your debt, or anything. It's definitely, definitely not like that!

00:11:36.460 --> 00:11:38.610
Let's go, Nanael-san.

00:11:38.610 --> 00:11:41.660
A-A-Ahoy! It'll be my pleasure!

00:11:46.610 --> 00:11:49.850
I woke surprisingly early.

00:11:49.850 --> 00:11:52.770
Let's tyrannize once more, princess!

00:11:53.690 --> 00:11:56.940
Leaving that aside, the Kingdom of Amara must once again...

00:12:03.740 --> 00:12:04.840
Father...

00:12:05.570 --> 00:12:07.890
I have returned from Gainos.

00:12:07.890 --> 00:12:10.540
Elina? What business do you have here?

00:12:11.080 --> 00:12:13.500
I must fulfill my duty as Captain of the Imperial Guard.

00:12:13.500 --> 00:12:14.960
I see.

00:12:14.960 --> 00:12:17.080
However, that is unnecessary.

00:12:17.080 --> 00:12:21.790
But from now on, war and rebellion will occur in our territory.

00:12:21.790 --> 00:12:24.130
It is our duty to stop this.

00:12:24.860 --> 00:12:27.100
I told you, it is not necessary.

00:12:28.310 --> 00:12:29.600
Elina.

00:12:29.600 --> 00:12:35.560
I sacrified everything... in order to gain the power to defeat the Queen.

00:12:35.560 --> 00:12:38.840
This was not the Vance's longstanding desire.

00:12:38.840 --> 00:12:41.490
It was a battle to avenge Maria.

00:12:42.030 --> 00:12:44.220
You plan to take revenge with your own hands...

00:12:45.110 --> 00:12:47.410
and not through Queen's Blade?

00:12:47.410 --> 00:12:49.300
Elina.

00:12:49.300 --> 00:12:52.500
You and Leina are both just like Maria.

00:12:52.500 --> 00:12:54.260
Like Mother?

00:12:54.260 --> 00:12:56.370
Do not concern yourself with me.

00:12:56.370 --> 00:12:59.750
Proceed down your own path, Elina.

00:13:01.000 --> 00:13:02.500
Father...

00:13:02.500 --> 00:13:03.670
I will do so.

00:13:04.380 --> 00:13:07.830
However, this will have to come before that...

00:13:07.830 --> 00:13:11.050
since I decided to protect you, Father.

00:13:13.020 --> 00:13:16.770
Your treasures seem to have escaped.

00:13:27.360 --> 00:13:28.700
Did you see that?

00:13:28.700 --> 00:13:29.650
I did!

00:13:29.650 --> 00:13:30.450
She isn't human!

00:13:30.450 --> 00:13:31.230
She's a monster.

00:13:31.230 --> 00:13:32.130
She has to be!

00:13:32.130 --> 00:13:33.250
The Queen is a monster?!

00:13:34.000 --> 00:13:36.530
Again? So it's happened again...

00:13:36.530 --> 00:13:40.680
In these 8 years, I have controlled the continent as I liked.

00:13:40.680 --> 00:13:43.720
I was only called a monster by these humans...

00:13:43.720 --> 00:13:45.170
In the end, you are just humans!

00:13:45.170 --> 00:13:48.700
That's right. That is human nature.

00:13:48.700 --> 00:13:51.640
They speak whatever narrow-minded thoughts they have.

00:13:51.640 --> 00:13:53.550
You should just kill them.

00:13:53.550 --> 00:13:57.100
Won't you hurry and remove the seal on your left arm?

00:13:58.440 --> 00:14:04.370
Watch from there as all who mocked me will receive their punishment.

00:14:10.160 --> 00:14:11.700
How could she have done this?

00:14:11.700 --> 00:14:14.870
Everyone here was turned into stone!

00:14:14.870 --> 00:14:17.970
Has Queen Aldra lost her mind?

00:14:18.580 --> 00:14:19.630
Unforgivable!

00:14:19.630 --> 00:14:20.750
Wait!

00:14:21.140 --> 00:14:22.690
Risty-san?

00:14:22.690 --> 00:14:24.110
Believe in Leina.

00:14:24.110 --> 00:14:28.000
She has taken responsibility for everyone's wishes.

00:14:28.830 --> 00:14:30.670
We have no choice but to believe in her.

00:14:31.310 --> 00:14:33.890
Aldra's victory hasn't been proclaimed yet!

00:14:33.890 --> 00:14:35.810
Kuchinawa...

00:14:35.810 --> 00:14:37.250
is shining.

00:14:37.810 --> 00:14:39.440
What's going on?

00:14:39.440 --> 00:14:41.110
Thunderclap, as well.

00:14:41.650 --> 00:14:45.770
I don't really get it, but my battle axe seems to be shining...

00:14:46.400 --> 00:14:48.250
Instructor, look!

00:14:48.250 --> 00:14:51.630
I have lived for a very long time, but this is a first.

00:14:51.630 --> 00:14:53.530
It is a very gentle light.

00:14:54.030 --> 00:14:54.920
Yes.

00:14:54.920 --> 00:14:57.960
These are Leina's... Leina's feelings.

00:14:58.560 --> 00:14:59.370
Leina...

00:15:00.000 --> 00:15:03.040
You really are the fighter I hoped you'd be.

00:15:03.040 --> 00:15:07.590
Well, then? Who will be the first to be stained with blood?

00:15:07.590 --> 00:15:10.760
If possible, I would like this to be done peacefully...

00:15:10.760 --> 00:15:15.800
My Mommy and Daddy are awfully strong, so you'd better give up!

00:15:16.350 --> 00:15:19.640
I will make you all my opponents...

00:15:19.640 --> 00:15:22.270
I am very hungry, after all.

00:15:22.270 --> 00:15:27.130
The Giant Slayer and Airi's sickle have been reacting strongly since earlier.

00:15:27.130 --> 00:15:28.190
This is...

00:15:28.190 --> 00:15:30.370
resonance.

00:15:30.370 --> 00:15:35.110
Mine was destroyed by Leina... but <i>this</i> is responding.

00:15:35.110 --> 00:15:36.530
The gold coin...

00:15:37.110 --> 00:15:39.200
Yeah, it's Leina.

00:15:39.710 --> 00:15:42.540
Don't sleep in that embarrassing position forever!

00:15:43.270 --> 00:15:45.540
Wake up, Leina!

00:15:48.300 --> 00:15:51.170
Well then, I did my part.

00:15:52.020 --> 00:15:53.460
Everything else depends on Leina!

00:15:56.070 --> 00:15:58.260
Thank you, everyone.

00:15:59.510 --> 00:16:00.680
Queen Aldra.

00:16:01.560 --> 00:16:04.350
Free everyone from those stone coffins at once!

00:16:05.400 --> 00:16:06.810
Are those your last words?

00:16:09.000 --> 00:16:10.110
That technique is...

00:16:10.400 --> 00:16:11.320
It's alright.

00:16:12.010 --> 00:16:14.020
Leina, you'll be fine.

00:16:14.020 --> 00:16:16.020
That kind of technique won't work on you.

00:16:16.890 --> 00:16:18.240
Shizuka.

00:16:26.580 --> 00:16:28.770
Secret Cleaver!

00:16:36.470 --> 00:16:38.470
This is how you use your trump card.

00:16:39.590 --> 00:16:41.180
I will not lose to you!

00:16:47.060 --> 00:16:50.900
Thunder Dragon Tail!

00:16:56.820 --> 00:16:58.740
I understand now, thanks to everyone.

00:16:58.740 --> 00:17:02.560
That understanding people through battling them is a great feeling.

00:17:05.830 --> 00:17:09.580
Victor: Vagrant Warrior Leina!

00:17:24.850 --> 00:17:27.270
Delmore, you said you didn't know about my little sister.

00:17:30.120 --> 00:17:32.530
Won't you stop that, Aldra?

00:17:32.530 --> 00:17:34.420
Why are you doubting me?

00:17:34.980 --> 00:17:40.280
Why?! I told you I know nothing, but even so...

00:17:40.280 --> 00:17:43.290
I thought that you of all people would understand.

00:17:43.290 --> 00:17:46.230
As the child of a demon and a human...

00:17:46.230 --> 00:17:51.330
I wished to take revenge on those
who banished me to the underworld.

00:17:51.330 --> 00:17:54.210
See, my beloved Aldra?

00:17:54.670 --> 00:17:58.130
Sorry, but I'm not interested in anything beside my little sister.

00:17:58.720 --> 00:18:00.920
I already know that.

00:18:00.920 --> 00:18:02.640
That's why she was in my way.

00:18:02.930 --> 00:18:06.620
That's why on that day, I left her in a place you would never find her.

00:18:09.880 --> 00:18:13.190
Shall I take your entire being, Aldra?

00:18:22.720 --> 00:18:23.870
Aldra?

00:18:24.590 --> 00:18:29.500
No! That's Delmore, an angel who fell from grace and became a demon!

00:18:30.060 --> 00:18:32.650
You're a talkative one, lowly angel.

00:18:32.650 --> 00:18:35.080
Thanks to becoming one with Aldra...

00:18:35.090 --> 00:18:39.500
I'll be able to partake of the delicious
wealth of emotions that all of you possess.

00:18:39.500 --> 00:18:41.760
I still haven't had enough, but...

00:18:41.760 --> 00:18:48.060
Aldra has removed the seal from her left arm. There is nothing that can kill me now.

00:18:48.060 --> 00:18:50.680
Then you shouldn't have any more need for her!

00:18:50.680 --> 00:18:54.810
No, no. The final feast still remains.

00:18:54.810 --> 00:18:57.100
Aldra's regret.

00:18:58.610 --> 00:19:02.630
Yeah, yeah. Enough with the drama, already. I'm getting tired of waiting.

00:19:02.630 --> 00:19:06.180
You aren't really into it, are you? Well, here we go.

00:19:07.000 --> 00:19:09.400
This is holy milk?!

00:19:10.420 --> 00:19:17.040
Well then, from here on out, I'll show you my cool side!

00:19:17.040 --> 00:19:18.880
Melpha, now!

00:19:20.520 --> 00:19:21.300
Eh?

00:19:24.370 --> 00:19:26.590
This girl's a complete idiot.

00:19:29.720 --> 00:19:32.140
Holy Pose: Confinement!

00:19:36.230 --> 00:19:39.800
Pull yourself together! You need to
search for your little sister, don't you?

00:19:41.050 --> 00:19:44.080
You'll even go as far as Hinomoto with your own legs.

00:19:46.540 --> 00:19:47.370
Quickly!

00:19:48.370 --> 00:19:51.330
Now! Everyone, beat the shit out of him!

00:19:51.330 --> 00:19:52.740
Agreed!

00:19:58.000 --> 00:20:01.910
Take this!

00:20:08.680 --> 00:20:11.850
Leina, beat that bastard up in my place!

00:20:26.170 --> 00:20:28.570
Everyone's been freed from the stone coffins!

00:20:28.570 --> 00:20:31.210
Look! Aldra is...

00:20:35.120 --> 00:20:38.120
This is Aldra's true form.

00:20:40.050 --> 00:20:44.550
Funikura-sama? It's me, Nyx. Please get a hold of yourself!

00:20:45.800 --> 00:20:47.440
Thank goodness.

00:20:47.440 --> 00:20:50.640
What? These clothes?

00:20:51.350 --> 00:20:56.390
P-Please forgive me, Funikura-sama! Please spare me!

00:21:00.270 --> 00:21:01.560
Echidna?

00:21:02.000 --> 00:21:04.480
Welcome back, Irma.

00:21:05.110 --> 00:21:06.920
Queen's Blade.

00:21:06.920 --> 00:21:12.330
The quadrennial tournament held to please the gods.

00:21:12.450 --> 00:21:16.560
The most fitting successor to the throne has been decided.

00:21:16.560 --> 00:21:20.270
Her name is: Vagrant Warrior Leina!

00:22:52.010 --> 00:22:54.970
Do you think we can return to the swamplands?

00:22:54.970 --> 00:22:57.100
That might be impossible.

00:22:57.100 --> 00:22:59.190
Well, if not, we can just rebuild
the Kingdom of Amara together-

00:22:59.190 --> 00:23:01.520
Who cares about that?

00:23:01.520 --> 00:23:03.520
I'm staying with Rana.

00:23:03.520 --> 00:23:05.280
What's with this?

00:23:05.280 --> 00:23:09.030
If it's come to this, I'll do it in four years, even if I'm alone!
